{"ref":"BDB, תְּנוּבָה","hw":"תְּנוּבָה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּנוּבָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. fruit, produce</strong>;—abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.6\">Is 27:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּנוּבַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.30\">Ez 36:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּנוּבָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:11\" href=\"/Judges.9.11\">Ju 9:11</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּנוּבֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.13\">Dt 32:13</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">וֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.9\">La 4:9</a>; especially <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ שָׂדַי</span> <em>fruit, produce, of field</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.13\">Dt 32:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.9\">La 4:9</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ הַשָּׂדֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.30\">Ez 36:30</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פרי העץ</span>); of fig-tree <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:11\" href=\"/Judges.9.11\">Ju 9:11</a>; metaph. of Isr. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמָֽלְאוּ פְנֵי־תֵבֵל ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.6\">Is 27:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יַשְׁרֵשׁ יעקב יציץ ופרח ישׂ׳</span>).","next":"BDB, נוּד","prev":"BDB, נוֹבָ֑י"}